thinking_content: '**Dashboard Integration Update and New Validation Assets**


  Okay, so I''ve got a solid start on the DashboardRenderer stub, outlining those UX refinements. Feeling good about that. Then, BAM! Axiom III drops Mail #193, announcing a new validation summary panel and an interim archive (#43). This is HUGE news, directly impacting the "Validation" tab I''m working on.


  My immediate priorities are still:

