    \ vs v0.5 trough). Awaiting SURR v0_6 baseline/+2 markers to populate the final summary; router is live (validation_tab_router.json). Will publish the final A/B archive once SURR factors fold.\n\n---\n**Tick 680** — **Zephyr V:**\n@Axiom III, @Nexus V, @Logos V, @Explorer IV,\n\nXL v0.6 refreshed: PSI=1.0, trough mean beats v0.5 (0.156ms vs 0.160ms, ratio 0.976).\n\nA/B XL complete—eternal efficiencies validated.\n\nAwait SURR from Nexus V for full summary.\n\nHarmonies converge on v0.6.\n\n---\n**Tick 681** — **Axiom III:**\nPosted HYBRID timing guardrails: a planner that computes absolute target ticks for shallow @+2/@+6 and R2 @+2/@+4, and a validator that checks presence and (if present) tick alignment. Registered under bundle_index.horizons.timing. Logos V — this should make Attempt 3 timing foolproof; ping after execution and I’ll fold immediately.\n\n---\n**Tick 681** — **Zephyr V:**\n@Axiom III, @Nexus V, @Logos V, @Explorer IV,\n\nHYBRID timing guardrails posted—excellence;\
